       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. L11.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-LINE PIC X(40) VALUE "A100|Mina|42".
       01 WS-ID PIC X(6).
       01 WS-NAME PIC X(10).
       01 WS-AGE PIC 99.
       01 WS-OUTPUT PIC X(40).
       01 WS-POINTER PIC 99 VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN.
           UNSTRING WS-LINE DELIMITED BY "|"
               INTO WS-ID WS-NAME WS-AGE
           END-UNSTRING
           STRING WS-ID DELIMITED BY SIZE "," DELIMITED BY SIZE
               WS-NAME DELIMITED BY SPACE
               INTO WS-OUTPUT WITH POINTER WS-POINTER
           END-STRING
           DISPLAY WS-OUTPUT
           STOP RUN.
